upstream: https://github.com/pbakaus/impeccable
source: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pbakaus/impeccable/main/.claude/skills/impeccable
verified: 2026-10-07
scope: directory
reason: two deliberate local edits (SKILL.md description, reference/animate.md pointer); every other file is byte-identical to upstream 0.1.11
note: SKILL.md frontmatter `description` is a deliberate local edit (f641f32,
  2026-09-29): upstream puts "Not for backend-only or non-UI tasks." at the end,
  past the ~240-character window Codex keeps, and has no Indonesian triggers.
  Local front-loads the boundary and adds them. Re-apply on any refresh.
  2026-09-29 routing pass (user request): the description opens with
  "Automatically run a critique/polish pass whenever frontend UI is built or
  changed" so the pass auto-triggers after UI work instead of only on request,
  and the first ~240 chars name the siblings that own adjacent concerns:
  public direction -> design-taste, admin IA and workflow -> admin-dashboard /
  admin-product-ux, browser proof -> ui-validation (which runs after this pass).
  The verb list moved after the boundary; no capability was removed.
note: reference/animate.md gained one local pointer line to design-taste/references/motion-craft.md (2026-09-30, user request). Re-apply on refresh.
would_lose_if_wired: an unguarded byte-for-byte refresh would drop the routing description and the motion-craft pointer.
refresh_guard: _refresh-vendored.sh skips this directory when .local-fork is present, before any fetch or write.
recheck: 2026-10-07 — merged upstream 0.1.11 (57 files; new reference/mode-{operate,persuade,read}.md, SKILL.md version 4.5.0
  with the loaded-symbols rule, hooks/new-work/visualize/component-review/animate and live-browser scripts updated).
  Upstream fixed the asset-producer.md -> component-review.md link, so that former local fix is retired.
